 r←Test_CreateButtonForm_011(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;msg;⎕TRAP;oldPixelSettings
⍝ Exercise "Dialog.Create": height test; the (nested) question defines the height
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 oldPixelSettings←2035⌶'RealPixel'
 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 msg←'Are you really really sure about this?' '' 'We have to be certain here!' 'A mistake can be fatal!' 'We don''t want this, or do we?' '' 'Therefore, think thrice!'
 parms.question←msg
 parms.buttons←'Yes' 'No'
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.CreateButtonForm myGuiParms parms
 ⎕DL 0.2
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.AdjustSize n
 :If ⍬ ⍬≡parms.posn
     {}n.∆Form #.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiHelpers.CenterIn myGuiParms.centerIn{(0∊⍴⍵):⍺ ⋄ ⍵}parms.centerIn
 :EndIf
 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
 {}2035⌶oldPixelSettings
